\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ADCD discovery and certification pipeline. Raw inputs $(y_\mathrm  {obs}, y_\mathrm  {cl}, \mathbf  {X}, \mathcal  {U})$ enter Stage~1 (dynamic mode selection via Spearman $|\rho |$). Stage~2 generates dimensionless arguments via Buckingham-$\pi $ with degree pruning and applies 6 structural templates. Stage~3 screens candidates through a tiered filter cascade (dimensional relaxation, numerical asymptotic boundary probe, coarse/fine Nelder--Mead parameter optimization, and Gate~E EBIC null test). Stage~5 applies the 4-step post-fitting epistemic validation protocol (budget disclosure, positive control, ablation margin $\Delta \mathrm  {BIC}_\mathrm  {ablation} \ge 10.0$, and computational reproducibility), yielding a 3-tier verdict (\texttt  {IDENTIFIABLE}, \texttt  {DETECTED\_\allowbreak  UNRESOLVED}, or \texttt  {WITHHELD}).}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{4}{The ADCD discovery and certification pipeline. Raw inputs $(y_\mathrm {obs}, y_\mathrm {cl}, \mathbf {X}, \mathcal {U})$ enter Stage~1 (dynamic mode selection via Spearman $|\rho |$). Stage~2 generates dimensionless arguments via Buckingham-$\pi $ with degree pruning and applies 6 structural templates. Stage~3 screens candidates through a tiered filter cascade (dimensional relaxation, numerical asymptotic boundary probe, coarse/fine Nelder--Mead parameter optimization, and Gate~E EBIC null test). Stage~5 applies the 4-step post-fitting epistemic validation protocol (budget disclosure, positive control, ablation margin $\Delta \mathrm {BIC}_\mathrm {ablation} \ge 10.0$, and computational reproducibility), yielding a 3-tier verdict (\texttt {IDENTIFIABLE}, \texttt {DETECTED\_\allowbreak UNRESOLVED}, or \texttt {WITHHELD})}{figure.1}{}}
